            "sid": "2CH 33:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Manase aĩ wa myaka ĩkũmi na ĩlĩ yĩla wambĩlĩlye kũsumbĩka; na asumbĩka myaka mĩongo ĩtano na ĩtano Yelusaleme. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.21.1+2KI.21.2+2KI.21.3+2KI.21.4+2KI.21.5+2KI.21.6+2KI.21.7+2KI.21.8+2KI.21.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Asu 21.1–9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na eekaa ũla Yeova wonaa wĩ ũthũku, akĩatĩĩa mothatyo ma mbaĩ ila Yeova walũngilye syume mbee wa ana ma Isilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.28.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Mav 28.3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nũndũ nĩwatũngĩĩie ĩngĩ kũla kũndũ kũtũlu kũla Esekia ĩthe wake wanangĩte; na ookĩlya ĩthembeo kwondũ wa Mbaalimu, na aseũvya Aselothi, na athaitha nguthu yonthe ya ĩtunĩ, na kũmĩthũkũmaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.16.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kũt 16.21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.17.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "17.3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.30.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Mav 30.14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
